    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Produced by\u00a0Jerboa\u00a0Interactive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A downloadable game for Windows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><strong><i> Solitude was developed by four students over the course of 1.5 years as part of a school project at Humboldt-Gymnasium Potsdam.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/5079c1c1dc03a2dab80a26dd4ca3780b.avif?t=1749242240\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash-landing on a hostile alien world, you must explore, survive, and gather the parts needed to repair your damaged spaceship. Face dangerous environments, hostile machines, and mysterious structures as you fight to escape the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided (and occasionally insulted) by your ship\u2019s sarcastic AI \u2014 \u201cTry not to die <i>again</i> this time, would you?\u201d \u2014 you\u2019ll traverse the desert in search of whatever scrap, tech, or ancient alien junk might help get your ship flight-ready. Expect challenges, surprises, and the kind of tough love only a malfunctioning assistant can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/b6a0fdbd46ebff8ad2a0c6e4bb03f43f.avif?t=1749242240\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unbelievable what these four young developers have created in such a short time alongside their final two years of High school. Graphics, atmosphere, gameplay, and mechanics are all on point and provide a solid half hour of fun leading up to an epic finale. A debut title that will hopefully be followed by more projects.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- T. Bauer, Supervisor Seminarkurs GameDevelopment Humboldt-Gymnasium Potsdam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/7ac584ea39e689e3b4eab38956e78004.avif?t=1749242240\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/b497328d24a1691af0565e48ab63411d.avif?t=1749242240\" width=308 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/ccf57b7b9db0649af45d7bcf98e5faae.avif?t=1749242240\" width=256 height=136 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Produced by\u00a0Jerboa\u00a0Interactive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A downloadable game for Windows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><strong><i> Solitude was developed by four students over the course of 1.5 years as part of a school project at Humboldt-Gymnasium Potsdam.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/5079c1c1dc03a2dab80a26dd4ca3780b.avif?t=1749242240\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash-landing on a hostile alien world, you must explore, survive, and gather the parts needed to repair your damaged spaceship. Face dangerous environments, hostile machines, and mysterious structures as you fight to escape the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided (and occasionally insulted) by your ship\u2019s sarcastic AI \u2014 \u201cTry not to die <i>again</i> this time, would you?\u201d \u2014 you\u2019ll traverse the desert in search of whatever scrap, tech, or ancient alien junk might help get your ship flight-ready. Expect challenges, surprises, and the kind of tough love only a malfunctioning assistant can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/b6a0fdbd46ebff8ad2a0c6e4bb03f43f.avif?t=1749242240\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unbelievable what these four young developers have created in such a short time alongside their final two years of High school. Graphics, atmosphere, gameplay, and mechanics are all on point and provide a solid half hour of fun leading up to an epic finale. A debut title that will hopefully be followed by more projects.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- T. Bauer, Supervisor Seminarkurs GameDevelopment Humboldt-Gymnasium Potsdam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/7ac584ea39e689e3b4eab38956e78004.avif?t=1749242240\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/b497328d24a1691af0565e48ab63411d.avif?t=1749242240\" width=308 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/ccf57b7b9db0649af45d7bcf98e5faae.avif?t=1749242240\" width=256 height=136 /></span></p>",
